<title>USA: Dynamic Materials names Santa CFO.</title>
<headline>Dynamic Materials names Santa CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, Colo. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynamic Materials Corp said Tuesday that Richard Santa has been appointed chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Most recently, Santa was chief financial officer for Scott USA and corporate controller of Scott Sports Group Inc before joining Dynamic Materials two months ago as the interim chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He replaces Craig Evans, who resigned in early August to pursue other opportunities.</p>
